<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">LEARN THE MOVEMENT</view><view class="title">先看清动作，再开始练习</view><view class="subtitle">9段动作示范 · 课前准备，随时回看</view><view class="tabs tutorial-tabs"><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="tab {{category===item?'active':''}}" bindtap="select" data-category="{{item}}">{{item}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view><view class="video-grid"><view wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="id" class="tutorial-card" bindtap="watch" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="poster-wrap"><image class="tutorial-poster" src="{{item.poster}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="play-badge">▶</view></view><view class="tutorial-body"><view class="name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="tutorial-description">{{item.description}}</view><view class="tutorial-bottom"><text>{{item.category}} · 动作示范</text><text>观看 ›</text></view></view></view></view><view class="hint">点击后手动播放，支持循环观看。按教师安排练习，先熟悉动作再开始。</view></view>
